# Shop-Books web — STAGING on Vercel (example only; set the real value in the Vercel project:
# Settings → Environment Variables, environment "Production", then redeploy).
# This value is PUBLIC (compiled into the JavaScript). It is only the address of the API.

# HTTPS origin of the Cloudflare Tunnel that forwards to the backend on your PC. "/api/v1" is
# appended automatically (you may also write it out). No trailing query string.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-tunnel-name.trycloudflare.com
